{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12954","headline":"初晴抱琴登马退山对酒望远醉後作 · 独孤及","name":"初晴抱琴登马退山对酒望远醉後作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年长心易感，况爲忧患缠。\n壮图迫世故，行止两茫然。\n王旅方伐叛，虎臣皆被坚。\n鲁人着儒服，甘就南山田。\n挈榼上高磴，超遥望平川。\n沧江大如綖，隐映入远天。\n荒服何所有，山花雪中然。\n寒泉得日景，吐溜鸣湔湔。\n举酒劝白云，唱歌慰颓年。\n微风度竹来，韵我号锺弦。\n一弹一引满，耳热知心宣。\n曲终余亦酣，起舞山水前。\n人生几何时，太半百忧煎。\n今日羇愁破，始知浊酒贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}